{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31088","headline":"送李殷游京西 · 薛能","name":"送李殷游京西","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"立马送君地，黯然愁到身。\n万途皆有匠，六义独无人。\n莫怪敢言此，已能甘世贫。\n时来贵亦在，事是掩何因。\n投刺皆羁旅，游边更苦辛。\n岐山终蜀境，泾水复蛮尘。\n埋没飡须强，炎蒸醉莫频。\n俗徒欺合得，吾道死终新。\n展分先难许，论诗永共亲。\n归京稍作意，充斥犯西邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31088.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31088","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}